<BaseLayout
  title="Refund Information | HVAC Training Solutions"
  description="How to ask HVAC Training Solutions about a current Boot Camp purchase or refund, and what must be confirmed before the new marketing site launches."
>
  <section class="policy-hero"><div class="policy-hero-inner"><p class="eyebrow">Refund information</p><h1>Need help with a purchase?</h1><p>Contact Ron directly about the current HVAC Boot Camp payment or a refund request.</p></div></section>
  <div class="page-shell policy-layout">
    <article class="policy-body">
      <div class="policy-review"><strong>Development review — final policy pending approval</strong><p>The existing public Boot Camp page offers a refund when a dissatisfied buyer contacts Ron within 30 days of purchase. The new site must spell out the approved details for both payment options before public launch. This draft does not change a purchaser’s existing terms.</p></div>

      <h2>How to request help now</h2>
      <p>Email <a href="mailto:hvactrainingsolutions@gmail.com?subject=HVAC%20Boot%20Camp%20purchase%20question">hvactrainingsolutions@gmail.com</a> with the name and email used at purchase, the approximate purchase date, your payment option, and whether you are requesting a refund or another kind of help. Do not send your full card number, PayPal password, or student password.</p>

      <h2>Before the new marketing site launches</h2>
      <p>Ron will confirm the 30-day window, how a request is submitted, what happens to access after a refund, how the remaining monthly payments are handled, and how long processing takes. The wording here, on the sales page, at checkout, and in purchase emails must agree.</p>

      <h2>Still deciding?</h2>
      <p>Review the <a href="/pricing/">two current prices</a>, the separate textbook purchase, and the <a href="/hvac-boot-camp/">course outline</a> before enrolling. You can <a href="/contact/">ask Ron a question</a> before making a payment.</p>

      <div class="policy-action"><h2>Write to us directly.</h2><p>Include enough information to identify the purchase, without including sensitive payment details.</p><a class="button button-dark" href="mailto:hvactrainingsolutions@gmail.com?subject=HVAC%20Boot%20Camp%20purchase%20question">Email about a purchase</a></div>
    </article>
    <aside class="policy-aside" aria-label="Related information"><strong>Related pages</strong><a href="/pricing/">Pricing</a><a href="/terms/">Course terms review</a><a href="/privacy/">Privacy review</a><a href="/contact/">Contact Ron</a></aside>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
